<content>I've successfully fixed the critical payment flow issue! Here's what was wrong and what I've corrected:

## The Problem
The original checkout system had a major security flaw where it automatically redirected users to the success page after just 2 seconds without actually validating payment completion. This allowed users to complete orders without making any real payment.

## The Fix
I've implemented proper payment validation with these key improvements:

